👑🧠 Birbal and the Hidden Treasure (Raw Story)

One day, a man came to Emperor Akbar.

He said, “I buried my treasure under a tree, but now it is gone!”

Akbar asked Birbal to find the thief.

Birbal called the man and asked, “Was there anything special about the tree?”

The man said, “Yes, it was a mango tree near my house.”

Birbal then asked, “Did anyone see you bury the treasure?”

The man thought and said, “My neighbor might have seen me.”

Birbal called the neighbor.

He said, “How far is the mango tree from your house?”

The neighbor quickly replied, “Not very far!”

Birbal smiled and said, “You knew the tree, so you must have seen the treasure.”

The neighbor became nervous and confessed.

Akbar praised Birbal.

💖 Moral:

The truth often reveals itself through small details.
